    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d195">

                <pb facs="0420" n="400" xml:id="pg400"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 13, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: With reference to your communication of
                    the 2d instant, relative to the capture of the British steamship Sir William
                    Peel, near Matamoras, by the United States gunboat Seminole, in the month of
                    September last, and to my reply, I now have the honor to enclose to you the copy
                    of a letter, of the 10th instant, addressed to this department by the Secretary
                    of the Navy.</p>
                <p>The protest and the chart which accompanied your note are herewith returned to
                    you.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be your lordship’s obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d195-a1.xml" xpointer="d195-a1"/>
